grd_foreign_note:"\u26D4 Different ledger branch: this backup was exported from another copy of the app (a different phone or branch) whose history this device has never shared. Merging it here could double-count money, so the merge is blocked.",bkgrd_diverged_note:"\u26D4 Diverged copies: this backup and this device both moved forward from the same older backup, so payments may have been recorded on both sides. The merge is blocked so no collection is ever counted twice.",bkgrd_legacy_note:"\u26A0\uFE0F Older backup: it carries no branch stamp, so its origin cannot be verified. Review the preview carefully before applying.",bkgrd_unguarded_note:"\u26A0\uFE0F This device has no branch record yet, so the origin of this backup cannot be verified. Review the preview carefully before applying.",bkgrd_override_label:"I understand the risk \u2014 merge this backup anyway (existing records still win; nothing is overwritten).",bkgrd_override_active:"\u26A0\uFE0F Branch guard override is ON for this preview. Existing records still win every conflict \u2014 check the totals after applying.",bkgrd_delta_title:"\u{1F9FE} Receipts side by side \u2014 this device vs this backup, before you decide:",bkgrd_delta_only_backup:"Only in this backup: {count} \xB7 {amount}",bkgrd_delta_only_local:"Only on this device: {count} \xB7 {amount}",bkgrd_delta_shared:"On both sides (kept once, never counted twice): {count} \xB7 {amount}",bkgrd_delta_voided:"Voided receipts are included in the counts as records, but their amounts are excluded from every total \u2014 the same rule used everywhere in the app.",dmerge_button:"Delta Merge (another device)",dmerge_title:"Delta merge from another device",dmerge_eyebrow:"MULTI-DEVICE DELTA MERGE",dmerge_rule:"Delta merge only ADDS records this device is missing (matched by record ID) from a checksum-verified backup. Nothing is ever deleted or overwritten: where both devices hold the same record with different details, yours is kept unless you choose the incoming copy for that record below. A safety snapshot is saved before anything is applied \u2014 if the snapshot cannot be saved, nothing is applied.",dmerge_summary:"Backup created: {exportedAt}. Main ledger: {stateSummary}. Sibling records: {added} new will be added, {unchanged} already identical, {conflicts} in conflict.",dmerge_state_summary:"{customers} new profiles, {bills} new bills, {payments} new receipts, {stateConflicts} conflicts kept as yours",dmerge_family_line:"{family}: {added} new, {conflicts} conflict(s)",dmerge_conflict_label:"{family} {id} \u2014 both devices hold this record with different details.",dmerge_keep_mine:"Keep mine",dmerge_use_incoming:"Use incoming copy",dmerge_apply_button:"Apply delta merge",dmerge_blocked_guard:"\u26D4 The branch guard blocked this backup, so the delta merge cannot be applied either. Use the standard Review JSON backup flow if you need the override.",dmerge_nothing_new:"Nothing new to merge \u2014 this device already holds every record in that backup.",dmerge_snapshot_failed:"Safety snapshot could not be saved, so the delta merge was NOT applied. Free up storage or download a JSON backup first, then retry.",dmerge_applied_toast:"Delta merge saved: {added} new records added, {resolved} conflicts took the incoming copy, {kept} kept yours. No record was deleted.",dmerge_void_notice_title:"Voided on the other device (still live here \u2014 void locally from the customer profile if correct):",dmerge_void_notice_line:"Receipt {paymentId} \xB7 Customer #{customerNumber} {name} \xB7 {amount} \xB7 {month}",dmerge_refused_toast:"Delta merge refused: {error}",dmerge_fam_shopSettlements:"Shop settlements",dmerge_fam_complaints:"Complaint register",dmerge_fam_tickets:"Field tickets",dmerge_fam_roznamchaDays:"Roznamcha days",dmerge_fam_inventory:"Stock book movements",dmerge_fam_homeBudget:"Home budget",dmerge_fam_loans:"Loan ledger",dmerge_fam_waTemplates:"WhatsApp templates",dmerge_fam_saadVisits:"Saad visits",dmerge_fam_s